gitrl-f (0.8.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * A double-click on a commit shows or hides its details and its diff, as
    Enter does. A single click only selects the commit. While the details
    show, they follow the selected commit.
  * On a commit that changes one file, a double-click fills the window with
    the diff, as Enter does.
  * The project moved to the gitrl-tools organisation on GitHub. The About
    window, the package and the AppStream data link to the new address.

 -- alexandros filotheou <alexandros.filotheou@gmail.com>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 11:40:53 +0200

